zstddeclib.c   the single-file Zstandard decompressor of zstd v1.5.7
               (https://github.com/facebook/zstd, release tarball
               zstd-1.5.7.tar.gz, SHA-256
               eb33e51f49a15e023950cd7825ca74a4a2b43db8354825ac24fc1b7ee09e6fa3),
               generated unchanged by its build/single_file_libs/combine.py:
               combine.py -r ../../lib -x legacy/zstd_legacy.h
                 -o zstddeclib.c zstddeclib-in.c
               (SHA-256 of the output
               5eb38abe0a7eea13674b312a006df72002d4192f0f0b4d09e6f03fb927a1f3d0).
